   "severity": "minor",
   "area": "motion",
   "title": "Entrance sequence is long",
   "evidence": "Load animations span 2992 ms.",
   "fix": "Keep the hero sequence \u22721.6 s from first paint to settled; shorten delays rather than durations. Visitors should be able to read the headline within ~600 ms."
  },
  {
   "id": "layout-properties-animated",
   "severity": "minor",
   "area": "motion",
   "title": "Layout properties are animated",
   "evidence": "154 animations/transitions on height, marginTop, margin-top, max-height, marginLeft; 47 inline-style layout writes.",
   "fix": "Animate transform and opacity (and clip-path for reveals) instead of width/height/top/left/margin; they run on the compositor and avoid reflow jank. For accordions use grid-template-rows 0fr\u21921fr or measure once and animate a scale/clip."
  },
  {
   "id": "too-much-ambient-motion",
   "severity": "minor",
   "area": "motion",
   "title": "Many elements loop forever",
   "evidence": "17 distinct elements run infinite animations.",
   "fix": "Limit ambient loops to one or two focal elements (a hero visual, a marquee). Constant motion everywhere competes with content and drains battery; pause off-screen loops."
  },
  {
